## Project Description

This project is a GUI-based measurement converter built using Python and PySide6. The application allows users to input a number and convert between inches and meters using an interface.

---

## Features

* Input field for numeric values
* Radio button selection for:
  * Inches to Meters
  * Meters to Inches
* Convert, Clear, and Exit buttons
* Result display rounded to three decimal places
* Error handling using message boxes
* Display of provided house image
* Accessible and readable UI design

---

## Technologies Used

* Python
* PySide6 (Qt for Python)
* PyCharm (or your chosen IDE)

