## How to Run the Program

1. Ensure Python 3 and PySide6 are installed

   ```bash
   pip install PySide6
   ```

2. Make sure the project structure is correct:

   ```
   project_folder/
   ├── asn7.py
   ├── house.png   (or inside /assets folder)
   ```

3. Run the program:

   ```bash
   python asn7.py
   ```

---

## Input Testing

The following test cases were used to validate functionality:

* Empty input > shows error message
* Non-numeric input ("ABC") > shows error message
* Negative input (-5) > shows error message
* Decimal input (5.5) > converts correctly(Rounded to .100th)
* Integer input (10) > converts correctly

Both conversion directions (Inches ↔ Meters) were tested.

